{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T18:55:02Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"q4af7", "Message":"So... I slightly engineered my T9 - just thrusters, pwr dist and FSD - and I now managed 400+ tonnes in about 1 hour. I'd say that's pretty good - especially considering most rocks where duds", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T18:55:25Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"q4af7", "Message":"And that is with 3 med. lasers", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T18:55:53Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"q4af7", "Message":"And a total of 7 active limpets.", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T18:57:44Z", "event":"CommunityGoal", "CurrentGoals":[ { "CGID":832, "Title":"Lakon Spaceways Mining Trials", "SystemName":"Andere", "MarketName":"Malzberg Vision", "Expiry":"2025-10-13T15:00:00Z", "IsComplete":false, "CurrentTotal":18347782, "PlayerContribution":26, "NumContributors":14844, "TopTier":{ "Name":"Tier 9", "Bonus":"" }, "TopRankSize":10, "PlayerInTopRank":false, "TierReached":"Tier 5", "PlayerPercentileBand":100, "Bonus":55000000 } ] }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T18:59:36Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"q4af7", "Message":"Would anyone agree that limpets (active) are one of the main limiting factors in mining builds?", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:00:39Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"m9vj3", "Message":"one of the factors, yes", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:01:01Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"8brhr", "Message":"monkey?", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:01:21Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"wnuz3", "Message":"see", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:01:33Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"8brhr", "Message":"who?", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:01:53Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"wnuz3", "Message":"monkey see monkey do", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:02:36Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"wnuz3", "Message":"stupid attempt of a jooke. Ignore me.", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:02:50Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"czny6", "Message":"so hey, does pirated mined goods count towards the CG?", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:02:55Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"8brhr", "Message":"think somebody was calling e monkey in my last fight", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:03:52Z", "event":"Friends", "Status":"Online", "Name":"9cty2" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:04:25Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"wnuz3", "Message":"never tryed to sell stolen goods to CG. Good question...", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:05:51Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"q4af7", "Message":"Someone said a couple of days ago pirated mined goods don't count, although I don't see how would the system know...", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:06:44Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"q4af7", "Message":"Do the goods get inked like stolen ATM notes? :-P", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:06:48Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"wnuz3", "Message":"well you have to sell them on black market so it is obvious it is stolen even if not masrked as one", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:07:12Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"wnuz3", "Message":"kind of they got marked as stolen", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:07:20Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"czny6", "Message":"well, not a lot of NPCs hauling Plat, Osmium or Painite, so it's Player piracy", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:07:45Z", "event":"CommunityGoal", "CurrentGoals":[ { "CGID":832, "Title":"Lakon Spaceways Mining Trials", "SystemName":"Andere", "MarketName":"Malzberg Vision", "Expiry":"2025-10-13T15:00:00Z", "IsComplete":false, "CurrentTotal":18371506, "PlayerContribution":26, "NumContributors":14850, "TopTier":{ "Name":"Tier 9", "Bonus":"" }, "TopRankSize":10, "PlayerInTopRank":false, "TierReached":"Tier 5", "PlayerPercentileBand":100, "Bonus":55000000 } ] }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:07:55Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"czny6", "Message":"if the player abandons some of it, it may get flagged as transfer and not counted because of that?", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:08:33Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"q4af7", "Message":"Oh, I see... never pirated anything so I did not know you had to sell in black market. That would rule them out, yes", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:09:15Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"czny6", "Message":"they get marked as stolen if you use a hatchbreaker to liberate them. if you convince the player you're pirating to abandon them they shouldn't get marked as stolen", "Channel":"starsystem" }
{ "timestamp":"2025-10-08T19:09:38Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"czny6", "Message":"of course, if the player just jettisons them, they probably count as stolen.", "Channel":"starsystem" }
